700K likes, 2,324 comments - dualipa on October 20, 2026: "Last night, Lincoln In The Bardo at The Met Opera 🖤 

@service95 has been honoured to be making a behind the scenes mini doc about what it takes to translate a novel of this calibre to one of the world’s most prestigious stages. George Saunders sat for an exclusive interview with Service95 which was filmed at the New York Public Library. 

The mini doc will premiere this evening UK time on Service95’s Youtube!".

